# =============================================================================
# COMMON KNOWN-KEY DICTIONARY · MIFARE Classic Tool (Android) format
# =============================================================================
# Well-known / factory-default keys for the native-Android path (NXP chipset).
# ONE 12-hex key per line; '#' lines are ignored by MCT.
#
# HOW TO USE:
#   1. Copy this file to the phone at:  /MIFARE Classic Tool/key-files/
#   2. In MCT, select it as your dictionary when reading your card back (Module 2).
#
# A fresh magic/gen2 blank uses these common factory keys by default, so a read
# succeeds without setting any key.
# =============================================================================

